  "description": "\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\t\n\t\tGalbot_G1_use_dryer_1\n\t\n\n\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\t\n\t\tDataset Description\n\t\n\nThis dataset uses an extended format based on LeRobot and is fully compatible with LeRobot.\n\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\t\n\t\tTask Preview\n\t\n\n\nView Video Directly\n\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\t\n\t\tOverview\n\t\n\n\nTotal Episodes: 620\n\nTotal Frames: 242533\n\nFPS: 30\n\nDataset Size: 3.30 GB\n\nRobot Name: Galbot_G1\n\nEnd-Effector Type: two_finger_end_effector\n\nTeleoperation Type: master_arm\n\nSensors: cam_front_head_rgb, \ncam_left_wrist_rgb, \ncam_right_wrist_rgb\n\nCamera\u2026 See the full description on the dataset page: https://huggingface.co/datasets/RoboCOIN/Galbot_G1_use_dryer_1.",
